<title>USA: Redbook sales said up 0.7 pct w/e Aug 16--sources.</title>
<headline>Redbook sales said up 0.7 pct w/e Aug 16--sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Redbook Retail Average, formerly called the Redbook Retail Sales Growth Index, was expected to show a rise of 0.7 percent in the period ending August 16, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc will report the Redbook Average later on Tuesday at 1440 EDT/1840 GMT.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
